Hosts thin like summer ponds --- Ravana charges Mahodara with last hope --- Mahodara plunges into foe and slaughters monkeys --- Sugriva hurls mountain rock --- Mahodara shatters rock and tree with arrows --- Sugriva kills his horses with a parigha --- Warriors break mace against parigha and musala --- Weaponless fighters grapple with fists and palms --- Fighters seize swords and circle for victory --- Sugriva severs his helmeted head